<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDEN TAKE WINNING 3-1 LEAD IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDEN TAKE WINNING 3-1 LEAD IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>LULEA, SWEDEN 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden took a winning 3-1 lead over Switzerland in their Davis Cup tennis World Group, first round tie after winning the first of the reverse singles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Thomas Enqvist beat Marc Rosset 6-3 6-2 3-6 6-2.</p>
